# -- Large captured media (kept OUT of git on purpose) -----------------------
# ~600 MB of theweddingcompany.com image/video captures:
#   public/webflow     ~394 MB
#   public/gcpimages   ~206 MB
# These stay on disk so local dev works exactly as before; `git add -A` will
# not pick them up. Host them in Supabase Storage (or Git LFS) when the site
# is deployed, then update the asset paths. See README "Media assets".
/public/webflow/
